the sheet as a person sees it:
     A         B         C         D        
   1 Item      Qty       Cost      Total    
   2 Widget            3       250       750
   3 Gadget            2       400       800
   4 Total                              1550
   5 Refusal                       REFUSED:>
   6                                        
a column too narrow: a number fills with # and text is cut with >
     C   D  
   1 Co> To>
   2 250 750
   3 400 800
   4     ###
the window offsets, and the row numbers stay with their rows:
     B         C        
   2         3       250
   3         2       400
the bar on a formula cell: D4  typed [=SUM(D2:D3)]  shows [1550]
the bar on a text cell: A1  typed [Item]  shows [Item]
the bar on a number cell: B2  typed [3]  shows [3]
typing nothing clears a cell: B2  typed []  shows []
